commit 342fc9a25ab39533bb48889d04359a3cf297c2ba
Author: Wayne <uvforce@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Sep 30 19:31:43 2026 +0800

    fix(chat): tell unanswered output truncation to compact instead of retrying (#968)
    
    * fix(chat): tell unanswered output truncation to compact instead of retrying
    
    A length stop with no text or tool call has no room for another message.
    Say so in English, Simplified Chinese, and Traditional Chinese, and offer
    compaction on the latest unanswered reply.
    
    * fix(demo): keep the demo icon path while adding truncation recovery
    
    ---------
    
    Co-authored-by: wayne.luo <wayne.luo@bybit.com>

